<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-18 lg:py-24">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-5">Sponsorship Prospectus</p>
            {# <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Virtual Event | October 14&ndash;15, 2026</p> #}

            <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-700">
                We are excited to extend an invitation for you to collaborate with CLIR/DLF as a sponsor for the 2026
                Virtual DLF Forum, the Digital Library Federation’s signature annual event, happening this year October
                14-15. The Forum offers immersive, multi-day experiences designed for learning, networking, and honing
                skills. It serves as a platform to inspire, forge connections, and foster the exchange of successes and
                setbacks within a vibrant community of digital library practitioners.
            </p>

            <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-700">
                Our 2024 virtual event welcomed 695 attendees from across the country and globe. Based on community
                feedback about reduced travel and professional development budgets after last year’s in-person event, we
                expect attendance to increase in 2026. We are projecting around 800 attendees for the virtual event, but
                we can accommodate an unlimited number of attendees.
            </p>

            <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-700">
                By sponsoring the 2026 DLF Forum, your brand will be closely linked to a rich, multidisciplinary network
                of professionals across the digital library, museum, archives, and cultural heritage sectors. Attendees
                range from project managers, technologists, and developers to administrators, archivists, and service
                providers. Our events attract participants from a spectrum of institutions, including art and cultural
                heritage institutions, non-profit organizations, government agencies, colleges and universities, and
                more.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-700">
                <p>Please don’t hesitate to reach out to the team if you have any questions: <a href="mailto:forum@diglib.org" class="text-primary underline">forum@diglib.org</a>.</p>
                <p class="mt-3">Thank you so much for taking the time to consider partnering with us to bring this exciting event to our community!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="callout callout-info mt-6">
                <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Important Deadline</p>
                <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sm">The deadline to sponsor our 2026 virtual event is <strong>Friday, July 31, 2026</strong>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

